WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.610
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.150
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they want to protect themselves, other people,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.830
or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.750
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.370
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.500
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.860
Your grudge shall be released.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:57.520
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.570
and the listed sponsors.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:09.880
Thanks, as always.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:14.340
Sorry, Fumio-chan.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:27.440
I don’t want to become Jigoku Shoujo!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.860
Which is why I’ll study, get into high school,

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.660
and although I still don’t know what I want to become…

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:39.000
I don’t want to be involved with the Hell Correspondence any longer!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.210
Make this life end soon!

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.400
Normally…

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.420
Live normally…

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:48.300
So, we should definitely stop by today.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.670
Sure!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.670
Mizuhara-kun, are you OK?

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.070
What? Yeah…

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:56.230
Let’s go.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.760
Yeah, later!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.550
Oh, goodbye.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.400
Mizuhara!

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.870
Will you come with me to the staff room for a bit?

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.140
Congratulations!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.770
You’ve been recommended to the Tokuei School!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.220
R-Really?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.030
Yeah.

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.290
Hurray!

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:19.990
I have to call mom!

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:24.900
Hey, other people are still facing exams.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.630
Don’t make a huge fuss about it.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.590
Oh, and…

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:34.830
Well, since you’re almost graduating, it’s a bit late, but…

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.090
What?

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:40.260
Haven’t I told you to stop wearing that wristwatch to school?

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.150
Oh, but…

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.570
I know.

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:46.390
It was a birthday present from your father, right?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.210
Regardless, it’s a bit too luxurious for a middle schooler.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.540
Got it?

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:52.830
I see…

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:01.080
Oh!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.910
Thank you, dad!

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.690
Oh, dad, you’re so hasty!

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.660
What? It’s basically the same as being accepted!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.860
It’s a reward for the hardworking Fumio!

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:11.630
Yeah!

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:14.200
Aw, we’ll miss you.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.180
Fumio-chan, you don’t have to pick a faraway school.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:20.420
Dormitory life is worrisome, too…

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.840
What are you saying?

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.000
Even within this prefecture, it’s a leading, prestigious school!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.750
If I remember correctly, they’re also famous in high school baseball.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.680
Isn’t it a happy occasion?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.780
But, I’m worried after all.

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:38.990
Let’s see…

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.990
I’m glad…

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.700
Hey, you’ve got something nice, haven’t you?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:08.900
Let us borrow it too, Fumio-kun.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:13.670
Come on, Fumi-chan, stay still!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.880
You won’t come out looking manly!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:16.940
Stop!

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:17.990
Stop it!

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.290
What?

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:21.650
Smile, since we’re being so nice as to tape you.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.120
Come on, smile, Fumio-chan!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.270
Stop it!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.670
No! Stop already!

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:32.350
I’ll give you that camera so forgive me!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.080
Really?!

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.530
You’re so big-hearted!

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:36.880
I’ll give it to you!

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.310
I’ll give you the camera!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.110
Hey, stop already!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:55.080
Hey, don’t think you can escape from us!

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:59.560
Even if you graduate, and go to another city, it doesn’t matter!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.760
I won’t let you go.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:04.690
I absolutely won’t let you go!

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:09.200
Why to that extent?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.690
Why me?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.710
I’m here.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.660
J-Jigoku Shoujo…

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.560
You’re really here?

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.460
Wanyudo.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.220
Sure thing, Ojou.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.580
Take this.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.420
T-This is…

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:00.170
If you really want to release your grudge,

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:02.860
pull that red string.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:08.270
If you pull the string, it will signify signing a formal contract with me.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.430
The one against whom you hold a grudge will be swiftly sent to Hell.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.910
I-I see.

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:16.000
Well then…

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.210
However,

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:21.800
if you release your grudge, you, too, will have to pay the price.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.940
Price?

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.610
Curse someone, and two holes are created.

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:30.230
If you agree, your soul, too, will fall to Hell.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.540
Unable to go to heaven,

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:37.970
your soul will eternally wander whilst tasting pain and suffering.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.960
Although, that’s after you die.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:43.490
W-What? To Hell?

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:47.320
W-Why do I have to go to Hell too?

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:49.430
Aren’t they the ones at fault?

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.080
Even though I’ve done nothing…

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.660
Curse someone, and two holes are created?

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.130
I don’t understand!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.190
Why am I the only one that’s so unlucky?

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.160
Why?

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:04.700
Are you sure you haven’t scarred anyone?

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:08.790
The rest is up to you.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.320
Big brother?

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:45.650
Oh, Suzumi, my bad.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:47.030
Did I wake you up?

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.380
Stay asleep.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:51.310
Today’s washer is your big brother, after all.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.170
The water’s kept running!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.910
We have to save on the water bill!

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.570
My bad.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.410
Oh no, using so much detergent!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.170
I’ll wash, so eat dinner.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.830
Oh, OK.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.030
Sorry.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:10.510
Hm? What are these bread ears?

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:13.690
I made mom sandwiches.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:16.130
She says she gets hungry after work.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.200
Wasn’t mom happy?

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.850
Yeah! I’ve made your share as well!

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:25.300
Thank you!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.900
Suzumi, you want to become a baker, right?

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:31.410
Yeah! Big brother, you want to become a baseball player, right?

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:34.320
Oh, are these those sandwiches?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.730
They’re delicious!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:40.210
Suzumi, you’re pretty good!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.590
Big brother, go to high school!

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.950
Huh? What are you saying so suddenly?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.930
Weren’t you saying you would join a high school with a strong baseball team,

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:50.580
and go to the national high school baseball tournament?

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:52.670
What was the high school called again?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.470
Um…

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:54.530
I forgot.

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:58.510
Why are we talking about this in the first place?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:04.520
Yeah, um, we don’t have a father, and mom’s really busy, right?

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.830
So, I’ve decided:

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:12.830
I’ll let mom work hard at work, and I’ll do everything here at home!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.970
So, big brother, you go to high school, and work hard in baseball!

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:20.010
What are you doing?

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.860
Brats shouldn’t be so cheeky.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:24.750
High school? No way!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.480
Working fits my disposition better.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.510
But…

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:30.880
It’s fine, don’t think too much about it.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.890
Your big brother will work as hard as he can, OK?

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:41.410
Make me lunch or something.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:45.730
When that time comes, make me some more sandwiches.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:48.930
Sure!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:11.010
Big brother…

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:13.050
Oh, you were awake?

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:18.070
What kind of person was our father?

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:19.140
What?

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:22.970
I don’t remember him too well.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.560
I see.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.160
Was he a nice person?

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.890
Y-Yeah…

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:34.750
I wonder why he left us and went somewhere else…

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.230
Are the exams coming up for all of you?

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:01.410
That’s how it is; it’s so much work…

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.260
I’m so anxious…

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.720
It’s all right, it’s all right!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.290
Work hard.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.590
Is she planning on absolutely ignoring us?

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:21.830
She probably doesn’t accept the fact that she’s the next Jigoku Shoujo.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:24.170
I wonder if it’s true…

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.070
That she’ll be the next Jigoku Shoujo.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.890
Ojou wouldn’t joke around.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:35.740
Do you really think Ojou would foster a new Jigoku Shoujo?

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:38.000
H-Hime, I said no!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.180
Hime, you’ll be yelled at by Ojou!

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:41.360
Hime!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.710
Do you want to tell us something?

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:46.100
I won’t lose to you!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.130
Hm?

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.700
Kikuri will be next after Ai!

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:53.150
Hey! Hime!

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:54.910
I’m very sorry!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:57.150
What was that?

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.310
Hime, he said!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.200
That idiot…

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:11.410
Now let’s take a look at the actual manufacturing process.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.970
Let’s look at each step.

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:19.770
Here I go!

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:20.970
Got it.

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:21.790
Here.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.060
Hey, did you know?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.510
Here I go!

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:26.660
This place subcontracts for huge companies!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:26.460
There!

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.820
Yeah, they’re number one in something in the prefecture, right?

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.520
The salary might be good. Right?

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.570
Yeah. I guess.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.340
Now, here I go!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.330
But isn’t it a waste?

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.630
Tomohide, you could’ve become an amazing pitcher!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:48.150
You should go to high school and do baseball!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:51.540
You idiot, I can’t afford to be doing baseball.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.140
That’s true, but when you become a pro…

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.210
Let’s not talk about this.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.250
Regardless, it’s something I’ve already decided.

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:00.670
Work, work,

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.140
I’ve got to work.

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:11.030
Hey, are you really going to return that camera?

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:13.400
I don’t understand.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:16.840
Fumio said he’d give it to us, so you should just take it.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:20.500
His family is rich, so it’s not a problem at all!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.870
Fumi-chan, what would you like to eat?

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.470
Uh, I don’t know.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.100
Mom, you choose.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.490
Fumio, is there something you would like to do in high school?

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.820
Nothing in particular.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.130
High school’s just a path to college anyway.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:36.590
To find something I’d like to do, I guess.

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:37.960
I don’t know for sure.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.420
Oh.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:51.950
Congratulations!

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.790
You’ve been recommended to the Tokuei School!

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.100
Amazing watch!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.190
I’ll give you that camera!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.610
High school’s just a pathway to college anyway.

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.990
Stop! I’m sorry!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:14.270
I’m sorry! Forgive me! Forgive me!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.040
This, I’ll give you this!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.590
Right? Right?

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:26.260
T-Tomohide!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:28.670
That’ll get us into huge trouble!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.670
Shut up!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:30.850
Let go! Let go!

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.100
Why? Why do you bully me?

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.260
Ask your own heart why!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.650
I don’t know! I don’t know!

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.070
Forgive me!

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:46.140
Did I do something wrong?

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.110
Shut up!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.220
W-Why do you bully me?

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.410
Why do you hate me?

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.540
I hate you, too.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.750
What is that?

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:08.260
I see. You too, eh?

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.330
You too?

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.380
How interesting.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.110
Go ahead, do it.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:19.740
Send me to Hell.

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:23.770
If that makes you feel better, I’ll go to Hell as much as you’d like.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.170
Come on, send me to Hell!

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.460
Send me!

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:30.020
Come on, what’s wrong? Send me!

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.510
You don’t even have the guts to do it.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.850
But, remember this:

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:45.090
Even if you send me to Hell, your life won’t change at all.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:47.290
You’ll never be happy.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.420
Never!

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:55.170
Your grudge has been received.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:00.630
He disappeared!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.110
He disappeared!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.590
I’m sorry, Suzumi.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:35.100
This grudge will ferry you to Hell.

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:43.420
The actual exams are soon, but now that you’ve come this far,

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:45.590
don’t push yourself too hard, and be careful about your health.

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.670
Got it?

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:48.200
Yes.

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:50.870
And, it’s about Matsuda, but

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.870
he apparently hasn’t returned home yet.

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:55.410
Anyone who has any idea-

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.030
It was Jigoku Shoujo!

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.120
What is it, Nozaki?

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:02.090
He was sent to Hell by Jigoku Shoujo!

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.920
Fumio asked her!

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:08.720
Fumio used a straw doll to send him to Hell…

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:09.500
He’s right!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.900
He disappeared right in front of our eyes!

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.350
Jigoku Shoujo sent Tomohide to Hell…!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.670
Jigoku…

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.770
Shoujo?

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:16.770
Really?

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:18.510
Jigoku Shoujo?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:19.630
What’s that?

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.780
You don’t know? Well…

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:25.010
Are you all planning on sending someone to Hell?

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.320
Is that true?

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:29.070
You, you, you, and you!

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:31.390
I won’t be sent to Hell.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:33.740
I won’t be sent to Hell!

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:35.820
I absolutely won’t be sent to Hell!

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:39.980
Everyone! Be quiet!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:48.530
The dormitory’s security is absolute, so you should have peace of mind.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:54.880
Wait, Katou-chan!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.030
Hey!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.600
If you fool around to much, you’ll get hurt!

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:00.890
Really, since they’re boys…

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:03.190
Would you say they’ve got too much energy?

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:05.420
Well, that’s a good thing!

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:10.280
Rather than staying indoors all the time, running about like that’s more healthy!

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.480
How fortunate of you, Fumi-chan.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:32.710
It’s over!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.390
I wonder if I passed…

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.300
There’s no use brooding.

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:38.200
Let’s go do karaoke!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.330
I’m hungry.

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:43.070
Hey, Tamayo, you get hungry a lot, don’t you?

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.270
Since I used my head…

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:48.190
That’s true, I haven’t eaten at all today.

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.440
For a while…

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:23.060
Are you still planning on running away?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:30.430
You said that people hating other people and getting hated by other people is unavoidable, right?

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.650
That Hell is inside a person.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:36.070
Then there’s no point to the Hell Correspondence!

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:38.270
You should just leave me alone!

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.890
Just let me be!

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:43.180
I’m going to high school!

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:47.890
I’m going to go to high school with everyone, and join a club, and get a boyfriend…

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:49.380
I want to live a normal life!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:53.130
I absolutely won’t be Jigoku Shoujo!

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:58.300
Right now, you hate me.

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:03.430
Don’t you want to send me to Hell?

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:26.410
Excuse me!

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:29.420
That girl…

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:42.260
Help me!

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:49.800
Note: Candle says Mizuhara Fumio.

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:49.800
Your grudge shall be released.

00:24:20.780 --> 00:24:23.060
I don’t want to be Jigoku Shoujo.

00:24:23.550 --> 00:24:25.460
I want to stay myself.

00:24:26.030 --> 00:24:29.480
I want to stay a third year middle schooler like everyone else.

00:24:29.480 --> 00:24:34.410
Taking exams and entering high school like everyone else…

00:24:35.890 --> 00:24:38.010
Please, let me be!

00:24:38.650 --> 00:24:43.460
I’m a normal girl you could find anywhere!

00:24:44.470 --> 00:24:47.570
Next time: Mayfly.

00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:55.880
